{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7torie","slide":5,"text":"This is the reveal. Kobo is not a crypto remittance app. It is a simpler way to move value across borders. The user thinks in euros, the person they care about and certainty. The live product's public waitlist is already framed as Euro in, USDC out. The app walkthrough follows that same mental model.\n\n[Sources]\n- Kobo waitlist: https://www.kobopayments.com/waitlist"}
